 "ops": [
  {
   "op": "sec",
   "after": "loc",
   "id": "bb-184-scheme-a",
   "h": "Peripheral Weakness — objective vs no objective weakness (Blackbook)",
   "html": "<div class=\"flow\" data-flow=\"b184a\"></div>"
  },
  {
   "op": "sec",
   "after": "loc",
   "id": "bb-184-scheme-b",
   "h": "Peripheral Weakness — with sensory changes (Blackbook)",
   "html": "<div class=\"flow\" data-flow=\"b184b\"></div>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "umn-lmn",
   "html": "<p><b>Weakness: objective vs no objective weakness</b></p><ul><li><b>Upper motor neuron:</b> increased tone and reflexes, Babinski reflex</li><li><b>Lower motor neuron:</b> decreased tone and reflexes, no Babinski reflex</li><li><b>Upper and lower motor neuron:</b> Amyotrophic Lateral Sclerosis, Cervical myeloradiculopathy, Syrinx</li><li><b>No objective weakness:</b> Cardio-pulmonary disease, Anemia, Chronic Infection, Malignancy, Depression, Deconditioning, Arthritis, Fibromyalgia, Endocrine Disease</li></ul>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "loc-ahc",
   "html": "<p><b>Motor neuron and motor neuropathy</b> (atrophy, fasciculations, hyperreflexia; no sensory changes)</p><ul><li>Lead toxicity</li><li>Progressive muscular atrophy</li><li>Hodgkin’s lymphoma</li><li>Polio</li><li>Multifocal Motor Neuropathy</li><li>Spinal Muscular Atrophy</li></ul>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "loc-root",
   "html": "<p><b>Radiculopathy</b> (sensory changes, follows distribution)</p><ul><li>Disc</li><li>Spondylosis</li><li>Tumor</li><li>Infection</li></ul><p><b>Poly-radiculopathy</b> (sensory changes, does not follow distribution)</p><ul><li>Spondylosis</li><li>Chronic Inflammatory Demyelinating Polyneuropathy</li><li>Neoplasm</li><li>Infection</li></ul>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "loc-plexus",
   "html": "<p><b>Plexopathy</b> (sensory changes, does not follow distribution)</p><ul><li>Brachial neuritis</li><li>Diabetes</li><li>Tumor</li></ul>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "loc-nerve",
   "html": "<p><b>Mononeuropathy</b> (follows distribution)</p><ul><li><b>Compression:</b> Carpal Tunnel, Ulnar, Peroneal, Radial</li><li><b>Other:</b> Trauma, Tumor, Ischemia</li></ul><p><b>Polyneuropathy (length dependent)</b></p><ul><li>Diabetes</li><li>Nutrition</li><li>Alcohol</li><li>Toxins</li><li>Paraproteinemic</li><li>Inherited</li><li>Inflammation</li></ul><p><b>Mononeuritis multiplex</b> (does not follow distribution)</p><ul><li>Vasculitis</li><li>Diabetes</li></ul>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "loc-nmj",
   "html": "<p>Fatigability, variability, oculomotor involvement</p><ul><li>Myasthenia Gravis</li><li>Lambert-Eaton Myasthenic Syndrome</li><li>Botulism</li><li>Congenital</li></ul>"
  },
  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "loc-muscle",
   "html": "<p>Proximal muscle involvement, elevated CK</p><ul><li>Polymyositis</li><li>Duchenne Muscular Dystrophy</li><li>Statin Toxicity</li><li>Dermatomyositis</li><li>Viral infection</li></ul>"
  }
 ],
